This directory is generated by `pnpm run generate` (Orval, config in
orval.config.ts at the repo root) from openapi/openapi.yaml. Do not
hand-edit anything under here -- CI's client-verify job re-runs generate
and fails the build on any diff, so hand edits get silently discarded on
the next regeneration anyway.

  - src/generated/models/       (TS types, one file per schema) -- generated
  - src/generated/endpoints/    (fetch client functions, tags-split by the
                                  same 9 domains as supabase/functions/) --
                                  generated
  - src/generated/zod/          (zod validators, tags-split, separate
                                  output from the fetch client) -- generated
  - src/generated/react/        (TanStack Query hooks wrapping the fetch
                                  client, tags-split, added for the
                                  "@coreverse/db-client/react" subpath
                                  export -- see src/react.ts) -- NOT yet
                                  generated in this environment (no network
                                  access here). Run `pnpm install && pnpm
                                  run generate` locally to populate it.
